github-workflow.schema.json is a copy of SchemaStore's github-workflow.json,
used to give the editor completions and hover text for workflow files.

Source:   https://json.schemastore.org/github-workflow.json
Fetched:  2026-09-12
Licence:  Apache-2.0 (SchemaStore/schemastore)

Refresh it by downloading that URL again; the simulator's own validation comes
from GitHub's workflow parser, not from this schema.
